From 54b5c33643db8b6b49b98d682a8ac18e06632341 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kevin <kevin@kevinlan.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 06:47:04 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] telephony: add minimal TelephonyMetrics stub for legacy
 MtkIms

Android 16 removed com.android.internal.telephony.metrics.TelephonyMetrics
(legacy clearcut metrics). Prebuilt MediaTek IMS APKs (such as TrebleDroid
ims-mtk-u / MtkIms.apk) still call TelephonyMetrics.getInstance() and its
RIL/SMS logging methods from ImsRILAdapter, causing com.mediatek.ims to
crash with NoClassDefFoundError on startup and breaking VoLTE and
SIM-less 112 emergency calls over IMS.

Provide a minimal no-op compatibility stub covering the five methods
referenced by MtkIms.apk.

Change-Id: I2553825f700e934287d02350cd171334f4a9430b
---
 .../telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java   | 41 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 41 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java

diff --git a/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java b/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..d8f2eb07a9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/metrics/TelephonyMetrics.java
@@ -0,0 +1,41 @@
